                {
                    "node": {
                        "id": "message:161113",
                        "subject": "Re: Sorting order login items, etc.",
                        "postTime": "2025-08-20T13:46:36.957-07:00",
                        "viewHref": "https://www.1password.community/discussions/1password/re-sorting-order-login-items-etc-/159723/replies/161113",
                        "body": "<P>I just upgraded to OSX v8.11.6 and this issue persists. Sort order keeps reverting back to Date Modified. So much clicking to revert sort back to Title / Alphabetical.&nbsp;</P>",
